1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000


2
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,520
We can't take Li Zhi'an to the ancestral temple

3
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:39,920
Why not?

4
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:41,400
What if she discovers our deception?

5
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,120
Our entire plan could be exposed

6
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:49,360
How smart can someone who believes in romance really be?

7
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,320
Besides, she's blind

8
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,200
Even if she figures it out

9
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:56,720
We'll just say the Emperor ordered me to find it

10
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:58,880
If she can't find it, we'll torture her

11
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:01,080
She loves me so much

12
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:03,200
When she hears this

13
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:05,400
She'll definitely reveal the whereabouts of the Dragon Jade

14
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:07,240
But what if she doesn't believe us?

15
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:10,320
What? Are you actually feeling sorry for her?

16
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,400
After spending all this time together

17
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:17,080
Have you really developed feelings for that blind girl?

18
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:20,760
Chen Lang, don't be ridiculous

19
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:23,480
The Seventh Prince is as dull as a block of wood

20
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:26,680
He doesn't even respond to someone like me

21
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,320
How could he possibly fancy that blind Li Zhi'an?

22
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:32,040
True enough

23
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:39,720
Is the Seventh Prince truly concerned about Li Zhi'an?

24
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:42,200
What charm does this blind woman possess?

25
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:44,160
Is it just because she comes from a purer background than me

26
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,720
or more noble lineage?

27
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:48,440
Then this afternoon

28
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:51,360
we'll proceed with the plan to visit the Imperial Ancestral Temple.

29
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:08,480
Chen Lang, Chen Lang

30
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,640
Chen Lang

31
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,200
What are you doing?

32
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:15,440
Shouldn't you be preparing for the temple visit?

33
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:17,160
Then the protection for that family would lose its purpose.

34
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:21,960
I will definitely overturn the murderer's entire scheme

35
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:25,520
and expose his true face to the world.

36
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,400
Only then

37
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:30,120
can he understand the suffering of the survivors.

38
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,960
Quick, check how she's doing

39
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,080
Go check immediately

40
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:57,720
Your Highness

41
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,760
Why is she burning up like this?

42
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:08,760
I heard she was haunted by evil spirits at the temple days ago

43
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,760
got frightened

44
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,040
and has been ill for many days.

45
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:14,040
She used to be able to lead troops into battle

46
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,800
Now she probably won't survive

47
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:19,160
Sigh... Steward Duan told us to let her fend for herself

48
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,800
Let's hurry and not get involved

49
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,240
Let's go quickly

50
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:24,920
Let's go

51
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:32,200
She was possessed by evil spirits at the Imperial Ancestral Temple

52
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,880
What do you want from me?

53
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:10,080
Your Majesty, I've come to request medicine

54
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,640
Seventh Brother really knows how to enjoy himself

55
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:14,680
Have you already finished

56
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,920
the special Five Minerals Powder I gave you last time?

57
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,520
No, Your Majesty

58
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,480
What I request is

59
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,240
the Calming Powder

60
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:25,000
Because I've been having frequent nightmares recently

61
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:25,640
I...

62
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:29,200
I think the Seventh Prince looks perfectly fine and energetic

63
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:32,120
The amber and jade powder in this Soul-Soothing Powder

64
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:35,040
is specifically for treating fright and mental disturbances

65
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,400
In this mansion right now

66
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:39,000
the one suffering from this illness

67
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,440
who needs medicine

68
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:43,000
is probably only that blind girl

69
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:45,600
Li Zhi'an

70
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,520
Seventh Brother cares so much about her

71
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,480
even came specially to beg for medicine

72
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,280
Could it be you fancy her?

73
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:55,560
I don't

74
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,040
You two would actually make a good match

75
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,040
One being a sickly wretch

76
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,760
the other a jinx

77
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,480
How about

78
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:07,160
I just bestow her to you

79
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,880
After all she's blind

80
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,560
can't even tell who's who

81
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,760
Your Highness must stop teasing your humble brother

82
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:15,280
Li Zhi'an hasn't revealed the location of the Dragon Jade treasure yet

83
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:16,720
She cannot die

84
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:19,760
I can grant the medicine

85
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:21,840
but

86
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:37,240
Clean Yu Rou's feet thoroughly

87
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:40,520
Chen Lang, you're so naughty

88
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:23,840
Hua Mei

89
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,440
The Seventh Prince

90
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,080
You're such a kind person

91
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,720
Could you brew the medicine for Third Sister-in-law

92
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,240
Thank you so much

93
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,200
You're completely drenched

94
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:42,280
Yet the medicine remains dry

95
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:43,920
Here, take this

96
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,200
I'll hurry back immediately

97
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:44,320
The Third Prince suddenly decided to take you to the Imperial Ancestral Temple

98
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,120
We servants were completely unprepared

99
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:47,960
You should have had time for proper ablutions

100
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,640
I'll make preparations right away

101
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,800
This was his sudden whim anyway

102
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:53,080
There's no need for you to be nervous

103
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,600
Just make simple preparations

104
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:56,240
Understood

105
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:04,000
This scent...

106
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:21,200
Your Highness, are you alright?

107
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:26,320
Your Highness, I've brought you a medicinal ointment

108
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:28,760
It will help if you apply it to your hands

109
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:30,960
Who are you?

110
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,080
Why are you bringing me medicine?

111
00:08:33,160 --> 00:08:34,800
I'm just a humble maid

112
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,200
I must hurry away now

113
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,440
Or I might be discovered

114
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:54,000
It's the fragrance of wintersweet

115
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:04,920
So she was the one who sent me the healing ointment

116
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,560
It's Huamei

117
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:11,320
Huamei, are you injured?

118
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,360
Come here quickly

119
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:16,880
This clumsy servant broke a cup by accident

120
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,920
Quick, never mind the cup

121
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,320
Don't underestimate this wound

122
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,680
If it gets infected

123
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:26,360
And turns into an abscess

124
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,480
That would be serious trouble

125
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,640
Your Highness, I...

126
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,600
There's medicine in my dowry chest

127
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:34,160
Remember to apply it when you return

128
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:38,120
Your Highness, you treat Huamei so well

129
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,440
It's only right to treat you well

130
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:41,960
Huamei

131
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:44,760
You're probably the only person

132
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,440
I can truly trust in the prince's residence

133
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:48,880
Would you be willing to help me with something?

134
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:52,320
Of course, this servant belongs to Your Highness

135
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:53,680
Naturally I should be loyal to you

136
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,280
This maid will go handle it immediately

137
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:21,200
Your Highness, here's the medicine you requested

138
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,520
I was careful coming and going

139
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:23,440
No one saw me

140
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:27,640
Please prepare for our trip to the Imperial Ancestral Temple

141
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:29,160
Oh, one more thing

142
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:32,400
Your Highness, I just heard the maids saying

143
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:35,160
that there's a fire at the Imperial Ancestral Temple

144
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,440
You don't need to go now

145
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:37,720
The Imperial Ancestral Temple is on fire

146
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:38,920
Hmm

147
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:47,680
I remember the temple wasn't supposed to burn

148
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:50,520
Now my knockout powder will be useless

149
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:53,880
Damn it, I planned to use this drug

150
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:56,280
to get information from those spirit mediums

151
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,520
What's going on here?

152
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:01,040
Who could have done this?
